      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIDEN TIME (3) is the one on the improve and looks ready to win. Fitter for two runs back and put the writing on the wall last time when placed here at 1300m. Gets a chance. GARRIX (2) has panels on these in recent ratings after a top effort to finish third in the NT Derby. Coming back sharply in trip to a mile but did lead throughout to score this course and distance the start prior. Has the talent. BEAU FACTOR (1) has been thereabouts recently and will race on speed and give a sight. ANPHINA (6) was well off best last time but has a much better draw and has placed 3/4 this course and distance so she can turn things around. MR JONES (4) is yet to fire in two runs here but has finally drawn a better gate.",
